      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ದುರ್ಗಿ(ಮಾರಿಯ ಮುಂಡಿ) । ಯಗ್ಗದ ಶಕ್ತಿಗಳು\nಸದ್ಗುಣ ಸತ್ಯ ಮುಸುರಿಹರ - ಮುಟ್ಟವು\nಸದ್ಗುರುವಿನಾಜ್ಞೆ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "b249a49f6d4733f619d2b4e0e2e94a733a38de86713d79d17314f655352ffde8",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research",
      "cross_source_status": "reconciliation_pending"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0052",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 52,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ವಿಷಯಕ್ಕೆ ಕುದಿಯದಿರು । ಆಶನಕ್ಕೆ ಹದೆಯದಿರು\nಅಸಮಾಕ್ಷನಡಿಯನಗಲದಿರು - ಗುರುಕರುಣ\nವಶವರ್ತಿಯಹುದು ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "ca604da840ab88c2e23eb354ce8b83c1069e5499d334eafe4ad885bad5c71dbb",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research",
      "cross_source_status": "reconciliation_pending"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0053",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 53,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ತಂದೆಗೆ ಗುರುವಿಗೆ । ಒಂದು ಅಂತರವುಂಟು\nತಂದೆ ತೋರಿವನು ಶ್ರೀಗುರುವ - ಗುರುರಾಯ\nಬಂಧನವ ಕಳೆವ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "c6c2bca35a5a6ae09c5479e17a83a418779ec277d8944a3c23322ae6fcc816cd",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research",
      "cross_source_status": "reconciliation_pending"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0054",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 54,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಹುಸಿವನ ಬೇಹಾರ । ಕಸ ಹತ್ತಿದಾರಂಬ\nವಿಷಯ ಉಳ್ಳವನ ಗುರುತನ - ಇವು ಮೂರು\nಮಸಿವಣ್ಣ ಕಂಡ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "ec0116c0b5b2809af2007f294a8524329e92996a514290f3007f0245f81fe33a",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research",
      "cross_source_status": "reconciliation_pending"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0055",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 55,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಹಂದಿ ಚಂದನಸಾರ । ಗಂಧವ ಬಲ್ಲುದೇ\nಒಂದುವ ತಿಳಿಯಲರಿಯದನ - ಗುರುವಿಗೆ\nನಿಂದ್ಯವೇ ಬಹುದು ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "85ac62de5e2039698d987bd52558c26e031b5ccc9de04f10253c4b0834fec662",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research",
      "cross_source_status": "reconciliation_pending"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0056",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 56,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಹೊಲಬನರಿಯದ ಗುರುವು । ತಿಳಿಯಲರಿಯದ ಶಿಷ್ಯ\nನೆಲೆಯನಾರಯ್ಯದುಪದೇಶ - ವಂಧಕನು\nಕಳನ ಹೊಕ್ಕಂತೆ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "7572624a97505b5df61dd4c6a7a1dcc98ef5ca95f460835cf433eb98bbf4a066",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research",
      "cross_source_status": "reconciliation_pending"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0057",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 57,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಶ್ವಾನ ತೆಂಗಿನ ಕಾಯ । ತಾನು ಮೆಲಬಲ್ಲುದೇ\nಜ್ಞಾನವಿಲ್ಲದಗೆ ಉಪದೇಶ - ವಿತ್ತಡೆ\nಹಾನಿ ಕಂಡಯ್ಯ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "5c8625fe7a8980d3a6b0c7e582614cf91c0d52859747c660914ef4192c872a60",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research",
      "cross_source_status": "reconciliation_pending"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0058",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 58,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಭಕ್ತಿಯಿಲ್ಲದ ಶಿಷ್ಯ । ಗೊತ್ತಿ ಕೊಟ್ಟುಪದೇಶ\nಬತ್ತಿದ ಕೆರೆಯ ಬಯಲಲ್ಲಿ - ರಾಜನವ\nಬಿತ್ತಿ ಬೆಳೆವಂತೆ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "f1a720564f02e84374daf52f3ec568c8f555f871417e352f1e9606db06ff5bc3",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research",
      "cross_source_status": "reconciliation_pending"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0059",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 59,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಹಸಿಯ ಸೌದೆಯ ತಂದು । ಹೊಸೆದರುಂಟೇ ಕಿಚ್ಚು\nವಿಷಯಂಅಗಳುಳ್ಳ ಮನುಜರಿಗೆ - ಗುರುಕರುಣ\nವಶವರ್ತಿಯಹುದೆ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "e6124bf13b8989b72f6343ffeed923aeba93f8b748fd5ec1f0cc9e9de208c5c3",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research",
      "cross_source_status": "reconciliation_pending"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0060",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 60,
      "section": "ಜಾತಿಸ್ಮರಣ ಪದ್ದತಿ",
      "text": "ಒಂದೂರ ಗುರುವಿರ್ದು । ವಂದನೆಯ ಮಾಡದೆ\nಸಂದಿಸೆ ಕೊಳ ತಿನಿತಿಪರ್ವನ - ಇಅರವು\nಹಮ್ದಿಯ ಇಅರವು ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "3e5346ea582bb4902a71f9c092b6c551dd436e2451af0a355d8845d1b2738a39",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research",
      "cross_source_status": "reconciliation_pending"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0061",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 61,
      "section": "ಲಿಂಗಾತಿಶಯ ಪದ್ಧತಿ",
      "text": "ಕಲ್ಲಿನೊಳ್ ಕುಚದಲ್ಲಿ । ಬಳ್ಳದೊಳ್ ಪಿಕ್ಕೆಯಲಿ\nಎಲ್ಲಿ ಭಾವಿಸಿದೊಡಲ್ಲಿರ್ಪ - ಭರಿತನನು\nಬಲ್ಲವೇ ನಿಗಮ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "83178d414284e36eea15df2f0cf226bcf6157f0e2c98791e524c08275b2d6a86",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
      "canonical_status": "pending",
      "authenticity_status": "not_assessed",
      "rights_status": "license_recorded_review_required",
      "editorial_status": "research",
      "cross_source_status": "reconciliation_pending"
    },
    {
      "candidate_id": "CAND-0062",
      "canonical_id": null,
      "source_id": "SRC-002",
      "source_name": "Kannada Wikisource",
      "source_number": 62,
      "section": "ಲಿಂಗಾತಿಶಯ ಪದ್ಧತಿ",
      "text": "ಲಿಂಗದ ಗುಡಿಯೆಲ್ಲಿ ? ಲಿಂಗಿಲ್ಲದೆಡೆಯೆಲ್ಲಿ\nಲಿಂಗದೆ ಜಗವು ಅಡಗಿಹುದು - ಲಿಂಗವನು\nಹಿಂಗಿ ಪರ ಉಂಟೆ ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞ",
      "locator": "https://kn.wikisource.org/wiki/ಸರ್ವಜ್ಞನ_ವಚನಗಳು",
      "fingerprint_sha256": "b04bd97dd75cb956625199039358084229f6fd662c20f9b6f893483d8be553cb",
      "source_license": "CC BY-SA (Wikisource work page)",
